{"3760910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Erimos: Blood and Dust", "steam_appid": 3760910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4801460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erimos: Blood and Dust</strong> is a dark fantasy soulslike set in a cursed underworld where the sun never sets and no soul finds rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake with no memory, no name, and no understanding of why a dying world already knows you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven guardians carry the fragments of what you lost. Take them back. Face what they show you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punishing combat</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stamina, timing, and pattern recognition decide every exchange. One mistake is often the last one you get to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow into what you were:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grow through Vigor, Endurance, Strength, and Dexterity, unlocking the means to reclaim what was stolen from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses that test more than reflexes</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multi phase encounters built on aggression, pattern recognition, and knowing exactly when <i>not</i> to act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A look all its own</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >celshaded, giving Erimos its own distinct, grim atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erimos: Blood and Dust</strong> is a dark fantasy soulslike set in a cursed underworld where the sun never sets and no soul finds rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake with no memory, no name, and no understanding of why a dying world already knows you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven guardians carry the fragments of what you lost. Take them back. Face what they show you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punishing combat</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stamina, timing, and pattern recognition decide every exchange. One mistake is often the last one you get to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow into what you were:</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >grow through Vigor, Endurance, Strength, and Dexterity, unlocking the means to reclaim what was stolen from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses that test more than reflexes</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multi phase encounters built on aggression, pattern recognition, and knowing exactly when <i>not</i> to act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A look all its own</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >celshaded, giving Erimos its own distinct, grim atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A dark fantasy soulslike set in a cursed underworld where no soul rests. Recover your shattered soul, master brutal combat, and face the truth of who you were.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760910/32354176f5c5b01085614ac04b138fe492125c8f/header.jpg?t=1785719883", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760910/ff8d7606232f35e02c29d8628e612c93258cd1d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785719883", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760910/ff8d7606232f35e02c29d8628e612c93258cd1d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785719883", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><str